{"version":1,"content":"<p>SpaceX行政總裁埃隆·馬斯克近日表示，公司在業務規劃中假設不會向OpenAI出售任何算力。這番表態針對OpenAI行政總裁薩姆·奧特曼此前有關AI數據中心需求可能被高估的言論。馬斯克認為，如果OpenAI的產品無法帶動算力需求快速增長，那麼問題可能出在產品本身，而不是數據中心建設規模過大。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1586824.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T16:57:47.140918+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":152,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T16:34:40+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T16:50:51.217288+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T16:50:51.217288+00:00","content_hash":"618d30ae17aa9e852cee84f44d3af80ed5a4de799663b4749a62acd9682a3c69","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}